== Notes ==

*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The caster level (up to 10) is also added to the damage inflicted each [[round]] that the save is failed.
*There is an undocumented, artificial limit of 10 + [[caster level]] rounds on this spell to guarantee that it will end at some point.
* A creature still subject to an earlier ''combust'' or ''[[inferno]]'' will not catch fire; the initial damage is applied, but there will be no subsequent damage.

